7. **Byte-level adjudications of prior-claim conflicts (Rosetta wins).**
   - **Importer tail = 41 bytes** (13B header + 7×f32 bbox+pad; matches the
     historical schema stub exactly) — NOT the wiki's 38B. The parser's
     "38B + 3 zero bytes on ArkTexture" re-attributes the importer pad's
     last 3 bytes; both consume identical bytes (bit-compatible).
   - **ArkTexture entry ref = block link** to NiTexturingProperty (10,610)
     / NiTextureEffect (1,105) — the schema's "Texturing Property Ref"
     role CONFIRMED; the wiki's "slot/purpose index" is a mislabel.
    - **ArkTexture count = (field2 >> 8) & 0xFFFFFF == TRUE count in
      2,343/2,343 in-slice blocks (100%)** [F-14/AMEND-009: the previously
      reported "99.0% + 24-block variant family" is RETRACTED as a
      candidate-order artifact of this run's own decoder — 24 blocks
      (18 zero-count + 6 true-count-1/2) were mis-parsed by the frozen
      instrument; all re-derived from bytes (ARKTEXTURE_ZERO_COUNT_
      REDERIVATION.csv: 38 blocks, every row next-block-signature +
      type-index verified; ARKTEXTURE_FAKE_ENTRIES_RETRACTED.csv: all 24
      OOR + 3 NiNode + f1=15 ×24 / f1=0x1000000 ×3 anomalies attributed to
      fake entries); the prior wiki "4,838/4,838 PERFECT" claim is NOT
      superseded in-slice — it is CONFIRMED in-slice; corpus-wide outside
      the 2,363-file slice (2,475 files) remains OPEN].
   - **TexDesc "32-byte raw transform" = 5 labeled baseline fields**
     (Translation/Tiling/W Rotation/Transform Type/Center Offset);
     **"trailing u32 always 0" = Num Shader Textures = 0**.
   - **NiVertexColorProperty**: the "PE-SPECIFIC u32" claim is superseded —
     the same 10 bytes parse as the STANDARD schema layout (u16 + VertMode
     u32 + LightMode u32); the wiki split (u16×3 + u32) is a width-identical
     alternative; semantic adjudication between the two splits stays OPEN.
   - **NiTexturingProperty "field_A/field_B" = Apply Mode u32** (enum values
     {0,2} observed) — baseline label adopted.
   - **"numUvSets u16" ≡ "u8 count + u8 flags"** — bit-identical mappings
     (count=low6; tangent bit) — prior reading is an equivalent split.
   - **NiArkBillboardNode = NiNode + u16 BillboardMode** — alias CONFIRMED
     (22/22 closure).

